    "The snapshot diff shows the score source changing and scores moving by at most 0.5%; every rank change is listed and explained in the pull request",
    "A fixture whose run.streams differs from its stream results yields the stream-results count, and a guard fails if run.streams is read for the class",
    "The guard is a required check in core CI"
